R-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업 등</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 근로 불가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근로장학금 지급불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">휴학자는 휴학신청일부터 근로 불가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[ex)7.28</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 휴학신청 시</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7.27</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일까지 근로가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 